                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Vroeger was de <w>munter</w> een zeer gerespecteerd ambachtsman in de stad.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "In the past, the <w>moneyer</w> was a highly respected craftsman in the city.",
                                "tr": "Eskiden <w>darphaneci</w>, şehirde çok saygı duyulan bir zanaatkardı."
